<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOUTH WESTERN DISTRICTS BEAT EASTERN PROVINCE.</title>
<headline>SOUTH WESTERN DISTRICTS BEAT EASTERN PROVINCE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Western Districts beat Eastern Province 22-13 (halftime 19-6) in George on Saturday in the only Currie Cup rugby match to be played this weekend. </p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>South Western District - Tries: Conrad, Stoltz, Jacques Wolfhardt, Barney Vorster. Conversions: Braam van Straaten (2). Penalty: van Straaten.</p>
<p>Eastern Province - Tries: Chad Elcock. Conversion: Theo van Rensburg. Penalties: van Rensburg (2).</p>
